= Native union controller source checkpoint

This supplement preserves the exact newly authored N3 controller, its AST-only
mock tests, original launcher, source diff and independent byte/inode verifier.
The actual runtime files remain unchanged. Their original absolute paths are
historical facts, not relocation aliases or ready-to-run instructions. All
included configuration and unit examples are separately derived, explicitly
inactive and use replacement paths/hashes. No PID, start-time identity,
invocation, registration ticket or actual activation configuration is archived.

